    "title": "Privacy policy",
    "lede": "Hum sirf utni hi jaankari maangte hain jitni aapke numbers padhne, aapka bracelet banane aur use aap tak deliver karne ke liye zaroori hai. Yeh page batata hai ki woh jaankari kya hai aur hum uska kya karte hain.",
    "updated": "22 October 2026",
    "body": "*Yeh translation aapki suvidha ke liye hai. Kisi bhi difference ki sthiti mein English version hi maanya hoga.*\n\n## Hum kaun hain\n\nYeh website {{legalName}} (\"hum\", \"humein\") dwara chalayi jaati hai, jiski sthapna {{founder}} ne ki hai. Apne data se judi kisi bhi baat ke liye humein WhatsApp par message karein (link footer mein hai).\n\n## Hum kya jaankari collect karte hain\n\n### Jab aap is website ko browse karte hain\n\nWebsite khud aapse login karne ko nahi kehti aur advertising cookies set nahi karti. Humara hosting provider (Vercel) site ko secure aur theek se chalu rakhne ke liye standard server logs rakhta hai, jaise IP address, browser type aur kaun se pages request kiye gaye. Agar hum analytics on karte hain, toh woh sirf tabhi chalega jab aap cookie notice par \"Accept\" click karenge, aur aap footer se kabhi bhi apna faisla badal sakte hain.\n\nAgar aap humare kisi partner ke share kiye gaye link se aate hain (aisa address jismein /p/ ya ?ref= ho), toh hum 30 din ke liye ek chhoti cookie save karte hain jo batati hai ki aapko kis partner ne bheja, aur ek random visitor number, taaki ek visit din mein sirf ek baar count ho. Agar aap is dauraan order karte hain, toh partner ka code aapke order ke saath save kiya jaata hai taaki hum unhe unka commission de sakein. Partners aapka naam, contact details ya birth details nahi dekh sakte.\n\n### Jab aap 60-second reading lete hain\n\nAapke jawab (jismein bracelet pehenne wale ka naam aur date of birth bhi shaamil hai) mulank aur bhagyank nikalne ke liye aapke browser ke andar hi process kiye jaate hain. Yeh na toh humein bheje jaate hain aur na hi store kiye jaate hain, jab tak aap checkout par aage badhkar order place nahi karte.\n\n### Jab aap order karte hain\n\nOrders humari website ke checkout se place kiye jaate hain. Hum yeh jaankari collect karte hain:\n\n- naam, mobile number aur email address;\n- bracelet pehenne wale vyakti ki date of birth aur gender;\n- wrist size aur bracelet ka purpose;\n- delivery address;\n- aapko humare baare mein kaise pata chala, aur messages mein aap humein jo kuch bhi batate hain.\n\n## Hum iska use kyun karte hain\n\n- pehenne wale ke numbers padhne aur crystals chunne ke liye;\n- bracelet banane, pack karne aur deliver karne ke liye, aur aapko update dete rehne ke liye;\n- care, restringing aur aapke order se judi kisi bhi problem mein madad ke liye;\n- kanoon ke hisaab se zaroori records rakhne ke liye (jaise tax records).\n\nHum aapka data nahi bechte. Hum aapko offers sirf tabhi bhejte hain jab aapne unhe paane ke liye sehmati (consent) di ho, aur aap kabhi bhi opt out kar sakte hain.\n\n## Hum ise kiske saath share karte hain\n\n- Razorpay, jo payments process karta hai. Aapke card, UPI aur bank details seedhe Razorpay ke paas jaate hain; hum unhe na kabhi dekhte hain aur na hi store karte hain;\n- humara order database provider, jo humare liye order details securely store karta hai;\n- humara email provider, jo order details humari apni team ko bhejta hai (kabhi kisi aur ko nahi);\n- Meta (WhatsApp), agar aap humein message karte hain ya hum aapko aapke order ke baare mein message karte hain;\n- courier partners, jinhe deliver karne ke liye aapka naam, phone number aur address chahiye hota hai;\n- Vercel, jo is website ko host karta hai;\n- authorities, sirf wahin jahan kanoon iski maang karta hai.\n\nInmein se kuch providers apni security aur privacy terms ke tahat India ke bahar data process kar sakte hain.\n\n## Is site par videos\n\nAmmit Ji ke videos YouTube ka privacy-enhanced mode use karte hain aur sirf tabhi load hote hain jab aap play dabate hain. Play dabane ke baad YouTube ki apni privacy policy laagu hoti hai.\n\n## Bachche\n\nAgar bracelet 18 saal se kam umar ke kisi vyakti ke liye hai, toh order unke parent ya guardian ko hi place karna hoga, jo bachche ki taraf se uski details denge.\n\n## Hum ise kitne samay tak rakhte hain\n\nHum order details tab tak rakhte hain jab tak aapka order poora karne aur usmein support dene ke liye humein unki zaroorat hoti hai, aur tab tak jab tak kanoon ke hisaab se humein business records rakhne hote hain. Uske baad hum unhe delete kar dete hain.\n\n## Aapke adhikaar\n\nIndia ke Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 ke tahat aap humse request kar sakte hain ki humare paas aapke baare mein jo data hai woh hum aapko dikhayein, use correct karein ya delete karein, ya aap apni di hui consent (sehmati) waapas le sakte hain. Aap apni taraf se kaam karne ke liye kisi vyakti ko nominate bhi kar sakte hain. Humein WhatsApp par message karein (link footer mein hai) aur hum jitni jaldi ho sake jawab denge.\n\n## Grievance officer (shikayat adhikari)\n\n{{grievance}}. Phone: {{phone}}. Address: {{address}}. Aap humse WhatsApp par bhi sampark kar sakte hain (link footer mein hai).\n\n## Badlaav\n\nAgar hum is policy mein badlaav karte hain, toh is page ke upar di gayi date update kar denge. Humari [terms](/terms), [shipping](/shipping) aur [returns](/returns) policies bhi dekhein."
