    "body": "*Yeh translation aapki suvidha ke liye hai. Kisi bhi difference ki sthiti mein English version hi maanya hoga.*\n\n## In terms ke baare mein\n\nYeh terms is website par aur {{legalName}} ke saath place kiye gaye orders par laagu hote hain. Humari [privacy policy](/privacy), [shipping policy](/shipping) aur [returns policy](/returns) in terms ka hissa hain.\n\n## Guidance, advice nahi\n\n{{disclaimer}}\n\nNumerology readings, crystal suggestions aur website ka content traditional guidance ke roop mein diye jaate hain. Please inke basis par koi bhi medical treatment band ya change na karein, aur na hi koi legal ya financial decision lein.\n\n## Aapka bracelet\n\n- Har bracelet pehenne wale ka naam aur date of birth padhne ke baad banaya jaata hai, isliye aap humein jo details dein woh sahi honi chahiye.\n- Crystals natural hote hain. Har stone ka colour, pattern aur size alag hota hai, aur photos aur illustrations sirf andaaza dene ke liye hain.\n- Product pages par bataye gaye crystals woh hain jo har purpose ke liye traditionally use kiye jaate hain. Ammit Ji har pehenne wale ke liye final stones khud chunte hain, isliye aapke stones alag ho sakte hain.\n\n## Prices aur payment\n\nPrices Indian rupees mein dikhaye jaate hain aur inmein India ke andar free delivery shaamil hai. Orders ka payment pehle hi Razorpay ke through online (UPI, cards, net banking) kiya jaata hai; hum cash on delivery offer nahi karte. Aapka payment confirm hone par aapka order accept maana jaata hai, aur hum aapko WhatsApp par updates bhejenge. Agar hum koi order poora nahi kar paate, toh hum uska full refund karenge.\n\n## Delivery, returns aur restringing\n\nHumari [shipping policy](/shipping) aur [returns policy](/returns) dekhein.\n\n## Website content\n\nBracelet By Ammit naam, logo, text, videos aur designs humare hain ya permission ke saath use kiye gaye hain. Please bina pooche inhe commercial use ke liye copy na karein.\n\n## Liability (zimmedari)\n\nHum har bracelet ko achhe se banane ka poora dhyan rakhte hain. Kanoon jahan tak allow karta hai, kisi bhi order ke liye humari liability us amount tak seemit hai jo aapne us order ke liye pay kiya hai. In terms ki koi bhi baat Consumer Protection Act, 2019 ke tahat aapke adhikaaron ko affect nahi karti.\n\n## Sawaal aur shikayatein\n\nHumein WhatsApp par message karein (link footer mein hai) ya {{phone}} par call karein. Humare grievance officer {{grievance}}, {{address}} hain. Yeh terms India ke kanoonon ke adheen hain."
